    <item>
      <title>Shrinkwrap 0.6.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>PDFs are now sources. Each page renders separately as name-p1, name-p2, drawn directly at the target size rather than rasterized and resampled. The new @pdf tag keeps the PDF alongside the rendered pages instead of only archiving it, so "Post @pdf @png" gives you both.</p>]]></description>
